Subject: [PATCH] Send HID keepalives while waiting for fingerprint verification

Chromium times out idle HID transactions while fprintd waits up to 30 seconds.
Send UPNEEDED every 100ms during verification and PROCESSING before TPM work.
Keep denial and timeout handling intact, and serialize HID response packets.

